      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تربّى</span></b> , said of a child, (Mgh, Msb,) <i>He was,</i>
or <i>became, fed,</i> or <i>nourished;</i> (Mgh;) or <i>reared,
fostered,</i> or <i>brought up.</i> (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 1,
near the end of the paragraph. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَبَّيْتُهُ</span>: see 2.

